# Wiring snippet 4 — Sitemap entries

## `sitemap.xml` — append these two <url> blocks before `</urlset>`
(the sitemap generator only auto-discovers artifacts/, operator-log/,
benchmark/, and specimens/, and it preserves entries it doesn't manage):

  <url>
    <loc>https://lemonteed.com/rankings/</loc>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://lemonteed.com/rankings/house-shoe-matrix/</loc>
    <lastmod>2026-10-09</lastmod>
  </url>

## `image-sitemap.xml` — append this block before `</urlset>`
(format matches the generator's own entries):

  <url>
    <loc>https://lemonteed.com/rankings/house-shoe-matrix/</loc>
    <image:image>
      <image:loc>https://lemonteed.com/images/rankings/ep001/house-shoe-matrix.webp</image:loc>
      <image:caption>The House Shoe Matrix — 24 warm slippers, ranked.</image:caption>
      <image:title>24 Warm House Shoes, Ranked From Frugal to Pricey (2026)</image:title>
    </image:image>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://lemonteed.com/rankings/house-shoe-matrix/</loc>
    <image:image>
      <image:loc>https://lemonteed.com/images/rankings/ep001/og-house-shoe-matrix.webp</image:loc>
      <image:caption>Lemmy's Rankings #001 social card</image:caption>
      <image:title>24 Warm House Shoes, Ranked From Frugal to Pricey (2026)</image:title>
    </image:image>
  </url>

Order of operations: run the sitemap generator first
(`node scripts/build-artifact-pages.js --sitemap-only`), then add these blocks —
the generator preserves unmanaged entries, so either order works.
